      "py": "Wǒ bù chī ròu."
     },
     {
      "text": "你吃药了吗？",
      "tr": "Have you taken your medicine?",
      "register": "neutral",
      "context": "health",
      "sense": "s2",
      "py": "Nǐ chī yào le ma?"
     },
     {
      "text": "他从小吃了很多苦。",
