    "etymology": {
     "text": "Ideogrammic compound: 网 (‘net’) + 貝 (‘cowrie’ = money); simplified 买. Possibly from Proto-Sino-Tibetan *laj (‘to buy; to barter’).",
     "src": "Wiktionary (kaikki.org)"
    },
